  message: "Fixed. Added is_dir() guard in cmd_sketch and cmd_run after the existence check: print a clear error pointing at the file's parent directory and return 1, instead of crashing in _format_structure_tree_fallback with NotADirectoryError from Path.iterdir(). cmd_run also gained the missing existence check (it previously crashed with a different traceback for nonexistent paths)."  # 3904
